OL,3,GNEWSAMan 'flies like an eagle' for 93rd
OL,4,Abirthday
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has completed a zipline challenge
OL,7,Ffor charity for his 93rd birthday.
OL,9,FCharles Wylie told the BBC he had
OL,10,F"great fun" on the zip wire in
OL,11,FBrighton, East Sussex.
OL,13,F"Now I know what an eagle must feel
OL,14,Flike when it's swooping down on its
OL,15,Fprey," he said.
OL,17,FWylie, a former naval officer, abseiled
OL,18,Fdown Spinnaker Tower in Portsmouth for
OL,19,Fhis 92nd.
